% DESIGN-PLAN xsb-tabling-wfs step 6: a clause body runs once per subgoal -- a consumer suspends at tnot of an incomplete table and resumes, never re-runs (przy1's shape)
:- table p/0, q/0, r/0, s/0.
p :- tnot(s), q, tnot(r).
q :- r, tnot(p).
r :- p, tnot(q).
s :- tnot(p), tnot(q), tnot(r), write('negations once'), nl, fail.
test :- ( p -> write(p_true) ; write(p_false) ), nl, ( s -> write(s_true) ; write(s_false) ), nl.
